Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now they can't hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep attacking them, won't we level up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My spiritual power is already drained...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in a stalemate...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! A fireball appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It really appeared! Xiaohei, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensing in the game seems a lot simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense, otherwise regular players couldn't play at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, they're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're players, not real wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If they realize they can't do anything to us, of course they'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With so many of them, why waste time on just a few of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.93,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,True, they were probably just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.69,Default,,205,0,0,,And that big crisis just resolved itself like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm more curious about is why wolf players cluster together like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because wolf players can't attack their own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Within ten meters, wolf packs share a combined health bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That means unless you wipe out the entire health pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't take down a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When they swarm like that, I get killed instantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to fight that?! Who designed this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What an interesting design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you better fight me for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Elder Jiu, no one will fight you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.24,Default,,0,910,0,,Nice, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:03.24,Default,,840,0,0,,Nice hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:17.42,Default,,0,800,160,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:17.42,Default,,800,0,160,,Went up another two levels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting used to it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I get familiar with the attack patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll support you guys as a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My fireball got bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're improving pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The map shows there should be a city beyond the mountain ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So big! And the style is completely different from the last city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(978,782)}“Please change your clothes.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a dress code too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(1026,546)}“Wardrobe”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go! Into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many people in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't belong to this faction. Everyone here is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we reach a certain level of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it's best to avoid places with too many players.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That way we can maintain Xiaohei's advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(390,674)}“Today's Play Time”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Logging off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a game be this fun? The immersion is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's... going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me answer that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Young one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A GHOST!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! Show some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Creation-type,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind-type,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Life-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,These skills create an illusion of rebound that makes people afraid to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A very interesting idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In reality, elfin rarely use so many types to explore a single ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but the game makes it possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it looks like he still got taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not skilled enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch, all style and no substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a "strong" human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They've only been using spiritual power for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe any human can beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't count as human! You're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This game will make elfin re-evaluate humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will let humans understand spirits too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew the Guild's biggest deployment would be inside a game...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all level 40 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like everything's going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check our completion progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fs70\pos(950,194)}“Praise of Yaojin King Fo Lan"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fs70\pos(876,470)} Quest Progress
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So far we've only gotten our levels up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No level-up skills at level 40?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:36.58,Default,,500,0,0,,The general skills compiled so far are Level Eye, Self-Heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,276)}“Level Eye”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,408)}“Self-Heal”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,540)}“Info”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,674)}“Shapeshift”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,806)}“Levitation”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\i1\pos(490,936)}“Spirit Space ”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.16,Default,,500,0,0,,Info, Shapeshift, and Levitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:41.29,Default,,500,0,0,,At level 150, "Spiritual Space."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:44.17,Default,,500,0,40,,Someone reached that level, but they died soon after.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.79,Default,,500,0,0,,No one's figured out its use yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else has reached that level since. Who knows what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at level 150 you can still die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, high-level deaths are a hot topic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a post dedicated to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,called "The Fallen Records"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(700,220)}“The Fallen Records”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,which tracks the 'death' causes of players who've been on the top 100 leaderboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,some fell into a crack and died stuck, some got poked to death while zoning out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and others were crushed by rocks, poisoned, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that one about being 'crushed by rocks'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this level 100+ expert whose logout spot was discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,While he was offline,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,thirty people piled rocks there until they made a small mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment he logged in, he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That can happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So now everyone either logs out in safe zones or does it discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die like that, who gets the XP?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea, haven't heard of anyone inheriting XP.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did that level 150 player die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... got stung by a scorpion. Couldn't handle the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the scorpion that stung him to death gained a bunch of levels from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now level 96.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If it stung us, we'd be done for too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of skill "Spiritual Space" will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Every living being has a spiritual space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's listed as a skill, it probably means more than just gaining one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some kind of application of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of players have already given up on leveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are obsessed with character customization and outfits,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,some have started gathering resources from the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and others run shops in the cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's formed a whole network of commercial districts and towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the system doesn't mandate it, players have mutually agreed on no-combat zones,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's becoming more and more like a real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people even randomly experience different lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a bird and soar freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a fish and swim freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Die and just try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,After we finish the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,let's play a different way too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can slowly start working on the other quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We might run into enemies along the way, which will help us level up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish are players too, so why would they take the bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably have quests that require them to steal food from hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is like fishing, testing both sides' patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quest complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you playing as an NPC?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No choice, I'm terrible at actual combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only rely on these kinds of quests for XP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically working for the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you get these quests?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very bottom of the quest board, there's a system quests menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four seconds! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's going to wreck another house...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Elfin can create a world this big just for a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean there are many such worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to have a spiritual space that large.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here should be very small.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... like a miniature model?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what state are we actually in right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our physical bodies should be asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and our consciousness is likely routed through the machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,controlling these bodies made by creation-type abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen knows so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, I just happen to have had a similar experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that our strength, speed, and reflexes are enhanced,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel really heavy every time I log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually feel more and more normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what it feels like to be an elfin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Found a new quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb Mount Panlilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems easy enough, you don't get tired in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at the map, it's right ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to climb that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! No more fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone stop fighting for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop fighting, can't you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Whose security alert?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's your alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:13.72,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Unknown person has entered the room]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.49,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Classified as a crime]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh- what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[Recording criminal evidence]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(908,228)}“Neutralize them with a\Nharmless electric current?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.62,Default,,220,0,0,,What? There's a feature like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[Invincibility mode activated. Please log out as soon as possible.]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry everyone, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Add me as a friend! Let's continue when you're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.50,Default,,0,450,0,,Hey, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.50,Default,,500,0,0,,And me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's higher than I imagined. No wonder so few have completed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You can see the completion count?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tap here. Currently it's 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't there a lot of bird players?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't they just fly up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's higher than what birds in the game can reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Temperature in the game doesn't seem to change with altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally a mountain this high would be freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So is this the tallest mountain in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably, this is the only climbing quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not picking the tallest, it wouldn't be worthy of its difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your spiritual power recovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gone up another five hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How many more jumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,About three more like that and we'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wonder what abilities those who made it up have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... maybe we'll find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The summit count now shows 10 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That means two more people just made it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, finally here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From here you can see several main cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't even see the edge! This world is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to jump off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't relax just yet. Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 40? A level 40 can make it up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 23?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:11.11,Default,,210,0,0,,Hey, little ones! Are you elfin too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, finally ran into someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice-type, Fire-type, Space-type...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...What kind of messed up type is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The quest point is up there. You should go quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! So much XP!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You all leveled up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's spar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior, we're just here for the quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not up to you. I came into this game to find opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You all step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The little one wants to face me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we a match for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're only level 23, beating them wouldn't be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gained 5 levels, they got the same XP.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That means when they reached the top, they were only around level 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, aren't we chasing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase what? If we actually fought, I'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the next quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The closest one is "Crossing."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this count as training?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, and it's so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so thrilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This world really is full of danger everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To others, we're dangerous people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There really are so many skilled people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, when we leveled up just now, a system quest triggered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(1182,540)}“Level 45 Threshold Quest”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 45 Threshold Quest? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our XP has already passed level 45,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:20:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but we need to complete this quest before our level can increase further.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have no choice but to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(1124,520)}“Defeat the Level 57 Player
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, doesn't seem too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We have two teleport chances to random locations within ten kilometers of the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How far are we from it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me check.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over a hundred kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost out of game time for today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we land far away, we can continue tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(1184,372)}“Teleport?”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's a high-level team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just passing through, we'll leave right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue teleport skill! That's exclusive to hunt missions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here to kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The teleport is random! Our target isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[Target is within 10 meters of you]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too close for random!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it answer me! It's doing this on purpose, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:32.62,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:37.36,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:42.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:48.26,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:54.41,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:59.21,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:03.89,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:10.41,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:21.73,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:27.15,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:32.19,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.19,0:22:43.42,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:48.97,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:55.81,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:32.62,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:37.36,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:42.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:48.26,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:54.41,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:59.21,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:03.89,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:10.41,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:21.73,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.73,0:22:27.15,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:32.19,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.19,0:22:43.42,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:48.97,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:55.81,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
